IMPORT prelude

-- The explorer's X2: the contract starts at -5, so P's deadline (3 after
-- the start) is at -2. An act at -5 or at -2 is in time and fulfils; the
-- tick past the deadline is at -1. The explorer's clock used to be floored at
-- 0, so it explored a contract that had already begun at 0 and every act it
-- tried was too late.

DECLARE Person IS ONE OF P
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF a

GIVETH A DEONTIC Person Action
negstart MEANS PARTY P MUST a WITHIN 3 HENCE FULFILLED LEST BREACH BY P

#TRACE negstart AT -5 WITH
